# ML Assistant — Complete Learning & Development TODO Roadmap

## How to use this roadmap

* [ ] Work on only one major phase at a time.
* [ ] For every phase: learn the concepts → build a small piece → test it → document what you learned.
* [ ] Don't learn AWS services that you don't currently need.
* [ ] Don't build the agent swarm before you understand a single agent.
* [ ] Don't build autonomous ML optimization before you can manually run and evaluate ML experiments.
* [ ] Keep everything in Git from the beginning.
* [ ] Keep cloud costs under control by using small resources while learning.
* [ ] Treat every phase as a working milestone.

