**Your goal isn't to finish this entire checklist quickly.**

Your goal is to reach the point where, at each stage, you can say:

> **"I understand why this component exists, I know how it works, and I built it myself."**

That approach will make the project both a **serious portfolio project** and a very strong way to learn cloud engineering, ML engineering, LLMs, and agentic systems at the same time.
